WEBVTT

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:10.270
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:20.140
Rental Magica

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:28.120
The shadow of the moon as it waxes and wanes...
Michikakeru tsuki no kage sotto

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:37.800
...gently stirs the beat of sorrow in your heart.
kanashimi no kodou furuwasu

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:42.490
Its wandering attraction...
Samayou inryoku

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:47.430
...reflected in your eyes.
hitomi ni utsushite

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:53.420
You will surpass the darkness of Ioneliness.
Kodoku no yami wo koeteyuku

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:59.120
You know that truth in your heart.
Shinjitsu wa kono mune ni

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:04.790
That gentleness will become your strength.
Yasashisa wa tsuyosa ni naru

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:09.430
Don't be afraid. Believe.
Osorenaide shinjiru koto

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:14.270
The brilliance that blooms in the cosmos eternally...
Sora ni saku kirameki wa towa ni

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:19.240
...embraces the voice of time.
toki no koe dakishime

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:24.310
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:29.050
Let me hear.
Kikasete

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:33.780
Wind, speak to me.
Kaze tsutaete

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:40.290
Tell me what courage is.
Yuuki wo

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:03.410
I'm right here...

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:11.630
Episode 5
MAGI NIGHT

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:25.070
We'll be delisted?

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:28.580
Since you became Astral's
new company president,

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:30.370
you haven't achieved
anything from your contracts.

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:32.880
Um... What about that job before?

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:39.090
I'm afraid a job of that caliber
can't be called an achievement.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:49.660
If you pass on this next contract,
I'm afraid I'll have to consider it.

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:58.530
Delisted, huh?

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:00.000
He's got a point.

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:04.840
The Association can't keep an organization
like that registered for very long.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:09.750
The main point is we have to do
a job that will keep us listed.

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:11.180
Exactly.

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:13.520
Yeah, you're right.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:27.230
Brother Pres, are you scared?

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.000
No, it's just...

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:33.770
Don't worry. I'll protect you.

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:35.030
T-Than-

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:38.810
A-Adelicia's also nearby, isn't she?

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:40.110
Of course.

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:43.050
She got the same materials from
The Association that we did.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:46.120
As to be expected from a top
ranked group like Goetia.

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.350
I don't detect a hint of their presence.

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:52.220
Still, why is Goetia competing for this contract?

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:55.790
The reward isn't very large in
proportion to the degree of difficulty.

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:57.700
Besides that...

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:02.660
Anyway, just hand over the
contract Astral's been given to me.

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:07.000
Now then, if you would be so kind.

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:12.310
She went as far as threatening you,
Brother Pres!

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.880
Well, it's no use trying to ask Addie about it.

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:16.580
She won't talk.

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:19.350
Come on, the Night's coming.

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:24.430
The request from The Association
is to seal this Night...

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:28.360
...without anyone noticing
or causing any damage.

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:34.260
However, our objective this time won't be that.

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:40.680
10, 9, 8, 7,

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:43.580
6, 5, 4,

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:46.170
3, 2, 1!

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:51.540
Brother Pres?

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.080
I... I'm fine.

00:04:56.760 --> 00:05:00.820
I confirm the spell wave contamination
has gone from level six to level three.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.020
Just like the data said.

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:07.900
The Magi Night is beginning.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:13.240
Boss, look.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.480
This is the Night?

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:21.980
Simply put, the spell power flowing
through the ley line has gone wild.

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:25.240
Think of it as an especially high-level
case of spell wave contamination.

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:28.350
But, why manifest the ocean?

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:31.650
This mountain was once
on the bottom of the sea.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:33.760
It's probably remembering that.

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:37.690
We're ready on our end.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:40.290
Mr. President, it's me.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.570
N-Nekoyashiki?

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:54.950
Araburu kami tachi woba
kamu tohashini tohashitamahi...

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:59.190
Perhaps they'd be better called
shikicats than shikigami.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:03.420
We'll be safe here with the
barrier Mikan is maintaining.

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.990
The misogi purification ritual...

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:09.050
...is a Shinto magic specialty
that purifies everything.

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:13.330
So, once we smash the core of the Night,
this sea will disappear, right?

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:16.540
Correct. The race will go to the swift.

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:19.170
Nekoyashiki, guide me, please.

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:20.500
Right, right.

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:23.840
Now, considering the stars tonight
and the flow of the ley line...

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:27.440
You should go in from the south-southwest.

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:28.710
Roger.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.610
Hang on, Mr. President.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:33.480
Here we go.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.760
We appeal and call unto thee!

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:42.760
We appeal and call unto thee!

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.830
We appeal and call unto thee!

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:48.670
By the power of the supreme lord,
who looks down upon thee from on high,

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.730
thou art commanded!

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:52.670
Thou shall obey!

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:56.010
By the name of the great one who
governs the spirits of the dead,

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:58.350
in the name of the priest
of the house of the dead,

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:04.010
and by the will of the first prince Apologia
of the 9th legion, we call upon thee!

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:07.540
Shinto magic to secure their position
by means of a purification barrier.

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:11.120
Onmyoudou to maintain their route
using the katagae technique.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.890
I wonder if they're using Honami's
Celtic magic to search.

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:21.020
How ineffective. Splitting the task
between different types of magic...

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:24.460
It's nothing but a waste of spell power,
time, and talent.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:28.070
Why does that magical group even exist?

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:34.980
I'll show you how Goetia does things, Honami.

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:38.850
What's wrong?

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:41.580
Looks like they're using brute
force as their strategy.

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:44.620
That's Adelicia's people?

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:48.890
They've summoned something nasty.

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:54.070
That'll be a pain. Shall I help?

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:56.400
You need to concentrate on your analysis.

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:57.570
Understood.

00:07:57.770 --> 00:07:58.410
Here it comes!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.200
Hang on tight, Boss!

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:08.540
We're gonna hit them!

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:30.390
Boss, I need your shoulder!

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:35.010
Agh, you're heavy!

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:36.030
Deal with it!

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:40.850
Hail! Goddess of the moon above me!

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.450
By the divine protection of
moonlight and mistletoe,

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:44.940
strike the calamity from the north!

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:01.670
You okay, Boss?

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:05.330
I'm airsick and I think I bit my tongue.

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:08.400
Besides that, there sure were a lot of them, huh?

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:10.970
Summoning something on that scale...

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:13.640
...is going to waste a fair
amount of spell material and power.

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:17.610
You want to say the expense doesn't
justify the result, don't you?

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:19.850
There must be a reason for it, huh?

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:25.720
And now the boss enters the stage.

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:29.590
I see. And?

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:32.530
Good grief!

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.100
What's wrong?

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:37.640
Apparently, somebody's magic
is lying behind the Night's core.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:41.380
It seems to be magnifying the
spell wave contamination.

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.840
What? You mean this isn't
a natural phenomenon?

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:47.570
If my friend's analysis is correct.

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:49.870
Mr. President!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:08.330
Even though I had the apprentices
use Shax, it didn't delay you at all.

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:11.640
So, now you've come to
deal with us directly, huh?

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:13.160
With Forneus there?

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:17.530
With him? Hardly. I wouldn't try that.

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:21.950
I have too much respect for you.

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:26.810
Come forth, Marbas!
The king who rules 36 legions!

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:35.060
Come forth, Glasya-Labolas!
The bold earl who controls 36 legions!

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:40.070
Come forth, Eligor!
The mighty knight who leads 60 legions!

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:47.000
F-Four in all?!

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:48.300
Ow!

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:51.340
You really do appreciate my skill. I'm glad.

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:54.450
Hear me, you three demons! Obey thy master!

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:58.550
Trample, pulverize,
and destroy my enemies! Now go!

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:17.700
Is it possible? Has he been awakened?

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:25.580
The demons were disintegrated in an instant!

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:26.840
What's going on here?!

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:29.680
Something... What is this?

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:33.650
Look! Look! Look!

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:36.490
Who... Who is this?

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.950
There it is. The true magic.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:43.860
The true... magic?

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:51.300
Boss!

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:56.510
Icchan!

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:17.090
As I thought. Goetia committed a taboo.

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:31.710
A-Adelicia?

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:37.140
Ow...

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:38.920
Well, if you have that much energy,

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:41.580
you're not being affected by
the spell wave contamination.

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:45.720
Where are we? I thought I fell into the sea.

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:50.760
Could this place be?

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:54.230
Inside the sea?

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:56.600
SAFETY FIRST

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:01.030
Ooh, it's cold.

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:05.810
I think the president is all right.

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:10.550
At the instant the leader of Goetia
and our president fell, the sea froze,

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:13.250
as though it was aiming for them.

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:16.520
As if it was rejecting any others.

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:19.720
That effect tells the entire story.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:27.690
A... Adelicia.

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:29.600
Let me help.

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:30.900
With what?

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:33.410
Aren't you getting ready to get out of here?

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:36.600
You can do that by yourself if you like.

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:37.300
Huh?

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:42.370
I finally made it inside the Night.
There's something I need to find.

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:44.010
Something you need to find?

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:46.310
It's no good.

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:47.450
What?

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:49.580
I don't have enough fetishes.

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:54.530
The equipment I have and a quickly drawn
magic circle aren't powerful enough.

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:56.990
Fetish? What can I do?

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:58.190
That's it!

00:13:59.030 --> 00:13:59.930
Give that to me!

00:13:59.930 --> 00:14:00.830
Huh?!

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:02.840
H-Hold it! Calm down!

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:04.530
Nevermind, just give that to me!

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:07.210
"That"? You mean this?

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:11.180
I... I can't just give it to you.

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:15.920
Then... I'll take it by force!

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:16.680
No! No!
Then... I'll take it by force!

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:19.380
If you need to find something, that's fine.

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:21.290
I'll help you.

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:24.550
But in return, we'll help each other
escape afterward, all right?

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:27.380
You say you'll help me?

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:29.030
We're in the same boat.

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:30.720
Give and take.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:33.020
How about it?

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:40.040
In the name of he who is absolutely
supreme, I summon and command thee!

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:44.200
Come before this circle and
reveal your true form!

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:46.710
Heed my commands and fulfill them!

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:51.350
Come forth, Eligor!
The mighty knight who leads 60 legions!

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:10.900
Hey, it's the best I can do with a
thrown-together summoning like this!

00:15:15.840 --> 00:15:18.640
Wow, it's frozen solid.

00:15:19.510 --> 00:15:22.950
The sea was frozen to capture Brother Pres?

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:27.050
No. I doubt they had any interest
in him since he isn't a mage.

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:31.020
Then why? Wait, for Big Sister Adelicia?

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:34.320
Somehow, we have to get to Icchan.

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:43.200
Honami!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:44.700
It's glowing.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:49.840
Icchan!

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:54.510
You don't have to look for it?

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:59.450
No, because this place is
essentially inside of its body.

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:03.460
He'll notice any traces of sorcery,
whether he wants to or not.

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:05.160
What do you mean by "it"?

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:11.020
We came to try and capture one of our
number who committed a taboo.

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:12.290
A taboo?

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:16.230
Don't breathe a word of this to anyone else.

00:16:17.570 --> 00:16:22.130
There are all sorts of rules that you
must never break in the world of mages.

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:27.210
One of them is that a magic
user must never become magic.

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:30.120
Magic user become magic?

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:31.820
You have a lot to learn.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:33.240
S-Sorry.

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:39.730
A mage who masters magic to the point
that his body itself become magic.

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:45.030
When that happens, he will spread spell wave
contamination simply as a byproduct of existing.

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:49.340
Then, this Magi Night is the work of the
mage who committed that taboo?

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:50.460
Exactly.

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:54.360
And that's why you tried to
take this job away from me.

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:56.840
It must be hard for you.

00:16:56.840 --> 00:17:00.040
The mage who committed the taboo
is one of your people, right?

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.380
And now you have to capture him.

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:05.750
You say that...

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:10.450
I'm the leader of Goetia.

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:14.290
It's only natural for me to take responsibility
for someone who committed a taboo.

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:17.730
Because you're the boss...

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:20.990
What about it?

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:24.700
Nothing. I meant that it's kind of cool.

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:29.970
W-With power naturally comes responsibility.

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:33.510
Eligor?

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:34.710
What's wrong?

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:37.140
I've found you.

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:55.130
W-What?

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:57.560
Magic...

00:17:58.240 --> 00:18:00.640
That's magic.

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:04.170
The mage who became magic!

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:06.940
I've found you...

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:11.810
My dear Addie...

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:15.380
Addie... I've found you...

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:19.190
It's been... so long...

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:21.930
Father.

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:24.800
It's your father?!

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:30.970
Father, if you insist on disgracing us
any more... I'll destroy you myself!

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:34.870
Dis... Disgrace...

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:39.380
It's a little brute force,

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:41.780
but I'm going to connect this
fire with the inside of the ice sea.

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:43.470
Connect it how?

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:47.150
There was a spell power reaction
from the president's badge before.

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:53.090
I think Addie may have used it for a summoning
and it came through my badge as well.

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:56.330
It's very weak, but I think
there's a path between them.

00:18:56.530 --> 00:19:00.230
Your and Brother Pres' badges are connected?

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.100
Honami, hurry!

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:25.250
Is that your answer, Father?

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:26.920
Yes.

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:41.570
Eligor!

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:43.670
What are you doing, Itsuki?

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:45.100
Snap out of it!

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:47.010
Adelicia, behind you!

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:58.090
My dear Addie...

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:03.430
My dear Addie...

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:08.400
You...

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:11.430
What are you?

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:24.950
What are you?

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:32.730
That eye... That eye is fascinating...

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:53.840
Sorry for the wait!

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:56.580
I wish you hadn't seen me like that.

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:06.320
We will meet again on another Night, Addie.

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:23.000
Mr. President, are you okay?

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:24.900
Um, yeah.

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:27.240
Oh, yeah...

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:30.910
Honami, what you saw here... It's a secret.

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:31.950
A secret?

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:33.180
Yeah.

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:36.980
I promised Adelicia.

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:41.590
Tell Nekoyashiki and Mikan, too...

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:44.190
Boss? Boss!

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:45.800
Boss, come on!

00:21:58.350 --> 00:22:07.950
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:22:08.360 --> 00:22:16.350
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:22:17.630 --> 00:22:29.410
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:41.320
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:47.590
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:22:47.660 --> 00:22:52.100
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:56.370
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:01.470
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:23:02.410 --> 00:23:13.340
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:23:13.720 --> 00:23:17.390
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:23:17.390 --> 00:23:21.620
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:23:21.730 --> 00:23:24.720
...and never let it go...
hanasanaide

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:27.070
