00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:27.730
Glam Sight [FAERIE EYE]
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:23:27.730 --> 00:23:29.140
Glam Sight [FAERIE EYE]
Mr. President, are you okay?

00:23:29.140 --> 00:23:32.110
Glam Sight [FAERIE EYE]
What is it with my right eye
telling me "look" all the time?

00:23:32.110 --> 00:23:32.340
Glam Sight [FAERIE EYE]
True, and since when it aches, it's a
danger signal, you need to take it easy.

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:36.140
True, and since when it aches, it's a
danger signal, you need to take it easy.

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:37.610
Right, I'll be careful.

